const faqs=[['How do I compare working with staying home?','Estimate take-home pay after deductions, then subtract childcare and work-related spending. Also examine lost benefits, retirement contributions and long-term career opportunities.'],['Does filing status affect the calculator?','Filing status is shown for context only. The tool uses your adjustable effective deduction rate rather than attempting a tax return calculation.'],['What if net cash from working is negative?','It means the listed childcare and work costs exceed the estimated take-home pay. The decision may still involve employer benefits, career progression, insurance and personal preferences.'],['Is this only for mothers?','No. Any parent or caregiver can compare employment and staying home.']];
